Without a default commodity, raw exchange balancing ignores unequal lot costs.

========== API ==========

aggregate()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity NEW
  format 1,000 NEW
commodity OLD
  format 1,000 OLD
account Assets:Shares
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Shares  1 OLD {{99 SEK}}
  Equity:Opening  -99 SEK
2024-02-01 Replacement
  Assets:Shares  2 NEW {{100 SEK}}
  Assets:Shares  -1 OLD {{99 SEK}}

========== WARNINGS ==========
